   "type": "file",
   "name": "config.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/extensions/tool-cordis/src/config.ts",
   "summary": "Config.listConfigs 检查查询的实现：从运行中 Loader 树投影活插件 Config——无 entry 参数时分页列目录（id/patchId/name/status），有 entry 时经 profile 包查表解析 packageDir 并把原生 Schemastery Config 投成带 $defs 的 JSON Schema 2020-12 文档。",
   "tags": [
    "inspection",
    "config-projection",
    "json-schema",
    "pagination"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex"
  },
  {
   "id": "function:packages/extensions/tool-cordis/src/config.ts:liveConfig",
   "type": "function",
   "name": "liveConfig",
   "filePath": "packages/extensions/tool-cordis/src/config.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    28,
    38
   ],
   "summary": "把一个 Loader entry 归类为五种 Config 状态：tree（group/include 载体）、inactive（disabled/未导入/已处置）、absent（无 Config）、unsupported（非原生 Schemastery）、schema（可投影）。",
   "tags": [
    "classification",
    "entry-status"
   ],
   "complexity": "simple"
  },
  {
